    <section id="exceptions" class="grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-[1.4fr_0.6fr]"><article class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-700 bg-zinc-900 p-6"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Content-integrity exceptions</h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-zinc-400">Unreadable files and checksum changes are isolated without interrupting successful checkpoints.</p><div class="mt-4 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">@forelse($recentItems as $item)<div class="rounded-lg border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950 p-4"><div class="flex justify-between gap-3"><strong class="truncate text-white">{{ $item->original_name }}</strong><span class="text-xs uppercase {{ $item->state==='retained'?'text-emerald-300':($item->state==='failed'?'text-red-300':'text-amber-300') }}">{{ $item->state }}</span></div><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-zinc-500">Position {{ number_format($item->position) }} · attempt {{ $item->attempt_count }}</p>@if($item->failure_code)<p class="mt-1 text-xs text-red-300">{{ str($item->failure_code)->replace('_',' ')->title() }}</p>@endif</div>@empty<p class="text-zinc-400">No checkpoint outcomes yet.</p>@endforelse</div></article><aside class="rounded-2xl border border-amber-800 bg-amber-950/20 p-6 text-sm text-amber-100"><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">Migration boundary</h2><ul class="mt-4 space-y-3"><li>The preflight reads but never changes source files.</li><li>No browser request carries 30,000 files.</li><li>No source path enters the database or evidence.</li><li>Inventory drift and checksum mismatch stop retention.</li><li>Transient retries are bounded to three attempts.</li><li>Failures never erase successful checkpoints.</li></ul></aside></section>
