-500">Reports and checkpoints retain safe labels only.</p></div></dl></section>
    <section id="recovery-controls" class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-700 bg-zinc-900 p-6"><div><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-violet-300">Operator runbook</p><h2 class="mt-1 text-xl font-semibold text-white">Unattended recovery controls</h2><p class="mt-1 max-w-3xl text-sm text-zinc-400">Every long migration can be inspected, resumed and retried without restarting successful work or weakening the immutable-source boundary.</p></div><div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-3"><article class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950 p-5"><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-500">1 · Inspect</p><h3 class="mt-2 font-semibold text-white">Create safe reports</h3><code class="mt-4 block break-all rounded-lg bg-zinc-900 p-3 text-xs text-emerald-300">archive:batch-preflight --json --csv</code><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-zinc-400">Capacity, invalid files, duplicate groups and EXIF coverage before import.</p></article><article class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950 p-5"><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-500">2 · Continue</p><h3 class="mt-2 font-semibold text-white">Resume checkpoints</h3><code class="mt-4 block break-all rounded-lg bg-zinc-900 p-3 text-xs text-emerald-300">archive:batch-import --until-complete</code><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-zinc-400">Bounded chunks continue from the first unprocessed position after interruption.</p></article><article class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950 p-5"><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-500">3 · Recover</p><h3 class="mt-2 font-semibold text-white">Retry transient failures</h3><code class="mt-4 block break-all rounded-lg bg-zinc-900 p-3 text-xs text-emerald-300">archive:batch-import --retry-failed=100</code><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-zinc-400">Only eligible failures retry, capped at three attempts; integrity failures stay isolated.</p></article></div></section>
